**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
# flutter tool 在包目录里落的状态文件（含 workspace 成员）
.flutter
.flutter_tool_state
.pub-cache/
.pub/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
/coverage/

