app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# 第三方原生解释器源码：按 apps/qfli_c/native/README.md 的命令 clone 进来，
